cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Time-Series World Models for Control"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mohammadi"
    given-names: "Esmaeel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/esmaeelMhd/time-series-simulator"
abstract: >-
  A domain-agnostic library for training recurrent world models on
  time-series data for model-based control, reinforcement learning, and
  model predictive control, with multi-step rollout training to reduce
  compounding prediction error.
keywords:
  - world models
  - recurrent state-space model
  - model-based reinforcement learning
  - time series
  - model predictive control
  - surrogate modelling
license: MIT
